# AI-generated reports & audits (keep the project ROOT clean)
# Audit / QA / coverage / release reports generated by tooling are ignored at
# the repo root so they never re-clutter it. Curated, permanent reports live in
# docs/reports/ (tracked) — move anything worth keeping there. The leading "/"
# anchors these patterns to the root only, so docs/reports/*.md stays tracked.
/*_AUDIT.md
/*_REPORT.md
/*_SUMMARY.md
/IMPROVEMENTS.md
/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md
/HEALTH_REPORT.md
